# Class: obo:HMDM_0000073 (drug class)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:HMDM_0000073 "A drug class is a set of medications and other compounds that have similar chemical structures, the same mechanism of action, a related mode of action, and/or are used to treat the same disease.")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:contributor obo:HMDM_0000073 <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9259-5280>)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace obo:HMDM_0000073 "human_microbiome_drug_metabolism_ontology")
