AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:31158845") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:34416161") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:HMDM_0000234 "The Bacteroides dorei 3-oxo-5-alpha-steroid 4-dehydrogenase (BACDOR_03091) product metabolize Levonorgestrel, drospirenone, and Norethindrone acetate. This enzyme (5-alpha-reductase) is also associated with three gene cluster (5-alpha-reductase, 5-beta-reductase, 3-beta-HSDH) in conversion of secondary bile acids acid 3-oxoLCA to isoalloLCA.")
